<footer class="bg-brand-surface text-brand-text pt-16 pb-12 border-t border-brand-border">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 mb-12">
    <!-- 左側: 社名・住所・SNS -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-5">
      <div>
        <span class="text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-muted font-sans block mb-1">技術の先にある、いごこちを</span>
        <span class="font-serif text-xl tracking-[0.15em] font-medium text-brand-text block">株式会社 加藤淳設計事務所</span>
      </div>
      <div class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-brand-muted space-y-1">
        <p>〒951-8142 新潟県新潟市中央区関屋大川前2-3-8-D</p>
        <p>TEL: 025-378-5087 / FAX: 025-378-6087</p>
        <p>Mail: <a href="#" class="text-brand-text hover:text-brand-accent hover:underline">kato@jun-arch.com</a></p>
