        >
          お問い合わせ・無料相談
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="text-right text-xs text-brand-muted">
        <p>Tel. 025-378-5087 <span class="text-[10px] text-stone-400">（受付 9:00〜18:00）</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 pt-6 border-t border-brand-border flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center text-xs text-brand-muted gap-4">
